chanisms: Ebbinghaus decay, retrieval-induced forgetting, reconsolidation, source-confidence decay.","Optional HEXACO personality, 6 orchestration strategies, guardrails, and voice across 11 LLM providers; 100+ extensions and 88 skills auto-load at startup."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/framerslab/agentos/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"0b19301f053e772048ee1857765f3599e0cb7dfa67483b76fe7def4b4c148968","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:39.120Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:39.120Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Agents that remember, forge their own tools, and survive long-running sessions. Persistent cognitive memory, optional HEXACO personality, multi-agent orchestration, and one dispatch interface across 11 LLM providers. Apache-2.0.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/framerslab/agentos/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Every roster agent can set its own provider, model, apiKey and effort; a parallel agency can require a provider quorum (quorum: { minProviders: 2 }) before it synthesizes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/framerslab/agentos/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0b19301f053e772048ee1857765f3599e0cb7dfa67483b76fe7def4b4c148968","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/framerslab/agentos/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:39.121Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T05:46:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/framerslab/agentos/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:39.122Z","hash":"0b19301f053e772048ee1857765f3599e0cb7dfa67483b76fe7def4b4c148968","originalBytes":19325,"storedBytes":19325,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["provider","memory","agentos","agent","tool","framers","full","api","hexaco","personality","const","history","llm","model","multi-agent","runtime","tools","typescript","voice","anthropic","cognitive","guardrails","orchestration","session","agents","default","docs"